# Andy

Personal design system. Headless Base UI + shadcn, Geist type, Linear craft. Tokens come from Grabbit.

## Visual rules

- Neutral does the work. Primary blue `#3B66E0` is punctuation — one main action, focus rings, checked states.
- Three radii only: 4 / 8 / 12 (`rounded-sm` / `rounded-md` / `rounded-xl` for panels).
- Spacing is a 4pt grid. Use `gap-*`, never `space-y-*`.
- Semantic tokens only: `bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`. No raw `bg-blue-500`.
- Geist Sans for UI, Geist Mono for tokens, code, and shortcuts.

## Component rules

- Prefer existing `@/components/ui` primitives. Do not restyle colors via `className`.
- Forms: `FieldGroup` + `Field` + `FieldLabel`. Validation: `data-invalid` on Field, `aria-invalid` on the control.
- Overlays always have a title (`DialogTitle`). Triggers use `render={<Button />}` (Base UI), not `asChild`.
- Menu items live in `DropdownMenuGroup`. Tabs triggers live in `TabsList`.
- Icons in buttons: `data-icon="inline-start"` and no sizing classes.
- Toasts via `sonner`. Loading via `Skeleton`. Status via `Badge`.

## Dual chrome

- Floating tools: elevated, compact, directional shadow.
- Content surfaces: flat, generous whitespace, primary only on the main action.
